portant.\n- This option contradicts the context, which does not mention virtue as the most important aspect of performance.\n\nD) The virtue, ability, diligence, performance, and honesty of civil servants are equally important.\n- This option aligns with the context, as it states that all aspects of performance are considered in the assessment.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct inference is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
