 the treatment of lupus erythematosus: This option is also related to the context, as it mentions the feasibility of a treatment plan for lupus erythematosus using artemisinin. Thus, this option is also likely to be introduced in the next part of the article.\n\nC) The contribution of scientific research works of traditional Chinese medicine to the world: This option is not directly related to the context, which focuses on the research of artemisinin and its application in treating malaria. However, it could be introduced in the next part of the article if the focus shifts to the broader impact of traditional Chinese medicine research.\n\nD) The cause of the problem of drug resistance of artemisinin: This option is directly related to the context, as it mentions the problem of drug resistance of artemisinin and the new breakthroughs made by Tu Youyou's team. Therefore, this option is highly likely to be introduced in the next part of the article.\n\nBased on the analysis, the least likely option to be introduced in the next part of the article is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
