jects of the Western Zhou Dynasty.\n     - **Conclusion:** Option C is correct.\n\n   - **Option D:** Some descendants of Guzhu were not subjects of the Western Zhou Dynasty.\n     - This statement contradicts the second piece of information, which states that some subjects of the Western Zhou Dynasty were not the descendants of Guzhu. Therefore, it is impossible for some descendants of Guzhu to not be subjects of the Western Zhou Dynasty.\n     - **Conclusion:** Option D is incorrect.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
