es not provide any information about the relationship between detergent dissolution and cleaning effectiveness. This option is not necessarily required by the argument.\n\nB) A washing machine gets clothes really clean only with a laundry detergent specially formulated for that machine.\nThis option states that a washing machine gets clothes really clean only with a detergent specifically designed for it. The context does not provide any information about the cleaning effectiveness of different types of detergents in front-loading washers. This option is not necessarily required by the argument. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
