ng every day for many years, taking care of their lives meticulously, and the elderly are very pleased. This option demonstrates that Lao Wu is showing love and care for his parents, which can be seen as a form of spiritual support.\n\nC) As the Spring Festival is approaching, Dean Li of the Sunset Red Nursing Home invited the Little Red Flower Orchestra of Chaoyang Primary School. The children's laughter and wonderful performances brought endless happiness to the elderly. This option shows that Dean Li is providing entertainment and joy for the elderly, which can be considered a form of spiritual support.\n\nD) Lao Jiang's mother is in her 70s, but she still refuses to accept her old age. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
