dea that Buddhism had to adapt to the reality of Chinese culture in order to survive, which is the main point of the passage.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) The power of traditional culture forced Buddhism to adopt flexible strategies in its dissemination.\n</answer>. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
