 ticked all those who did not get the full vote. Since Zhao Jie is one of the candidates, Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates.\n\n4. **Evaluate Options**:.\n   - **Option A**: Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other.\n     - If Zhao Jie is one of the candidates, Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates. Since Li Zilu ticked all the other candidates, he would have ticked Wang Ming. Therefore, Wang Ming and Li Zilu ticked each other.\n   - **Option B**: Wang ming and li zilu tick each other.\n     - As explained above, Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates, including Wang Ming. Therefore, Wang Ming and Li Zilu ticked each other.\n   - **Option C**: Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming.\n     - This option contradicts the fact that Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates, including Wang Ming. Therefore, this option is incorrect.\n   - **Option D**: Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming.\n     - This option contradicts the fact that Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates, including Wang Ming. Therefore, this option is incorrect.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:.\n\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
