 and women are not mentioned in the context.\n\nC) There are more girls than boys in the six brothers and sisters: This is incorrect because there are only two girls (B and C) and four boys (A, D, E, and the unknown sibling).\n\nD) A ranks third among the six brothers and sisters: This is correct because A is the only boy, and he is the third sibling in the family (after D and E).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D) A ranks third among the six brothers and sisters.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
