repreneurship and innovation.\n\n2. **Option B**: "The main body of entrepreneurship will move from the elite to the public." While the context does mention the rise of various entrepreneurial subjects, it doesn\'t specifically state that the main body of entrepreneurship will move from the elite to the public. The context focuses more on the rise of different types of entrepreneurs rather than their distribution.\n\n3. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
